  "id": "swiss-chard-and-pecan-pesto",
  "name": "Swiss Chard and Pecan Pesto",
  "subtitle": "A savory green pesto with pecans and Parmesan",
  "description": "Wilted Swiss chard and basil are blended with pecans, Parmesan, olive oil, lemon juice, and garlic for a versatile pesto.",
  "meal_type": "other",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
